  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-6-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=(x-1)^2e^{-x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,5 p.) Halla las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\) y calcula, si existen, sus extremos relativos o locales y sus extremos absolutos o globales (puntos en los que se obtienen y valores que alcanza la función).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\): sin verticales. \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{(x-1)^2}{e^x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim\\frac{2(x-1)}{e^x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim\\frac2{e^x}=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>: \\(y=0\\) en \\(+\\infty\\). En \\(-\\infty\\): \\(f\\to+\\infty\\) y \\(\\frac{f(x)}x\\to-\\infty\\): ni horizontal ni oblicua.</p><div class='res'>Asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) (en \\(+\\infty\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=2(x-1)e^{-x}-(x-1)^2e^{-x}=e^{-x}(x-1)(3-x)=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1},\\ \\boxed{x=3}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(4) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\) y \\((3,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((1,3)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Mínimo relativo en \\(x=1\\): \\(f(1)=0\\); máximo relativo en \\(x=3\\): \\(f(3)=\\frac4{e^3}\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><p><b>Absolutos:</b> \\(f(x)\\geq0\\) siempre y \\(f(1)=0\\): el mínimo relativo es absoluto. Como \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty\\), no hay máximo absoluto.</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\cup(3,+\\infty)\\), crece en \\((1,3)\\). Mínimo relativo y absoluto en \\((1,0)\\); máximo relativo en \\(\\left(3,\\frac4{e^3}\\right)\\); no hay máximo absoluto</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 190' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='34.3,-365.5 36.3,-298.8 38.4,-239.6 40.4,-187.2 42.5,-140.9 44.5,-100.1 46.6,-64.3 48.6,-32.8 50.7,-5.3 52.7,18.7 54.7,39.5 56.8,57.5 58.8,73.1 60.9,86.5 62.9,97.9 65.0,107.6 67.0,115.8 69.1,122.6 71.1,128.3 73.2,132.9 75.2,136.7 77.3,139.6 79.3,141.9 81.4,143.7 83.4,144.9 85.5,145.7 87.5,146.2 89.6,146.3 91.6,146.2 93.7,145.9 95.7,145.5 97.7,144.9 99.8,144.2 101.8,143.4 103.9,142.6 105.9,141.8 108.0,140.9 110.0,140.0 112.1,139.2 114.1,138.4 116.2,137.6 118.2,136.8 120.3,136.0 122.3,135.3 124.4,134.7 126.4,134.1 128.5,133.5 130.5,133.0 132.6,132.6 134.6,132.2 136.7,131.8 138.7,131.5 140.8,131.3 142.8,131.1 144.8,130.9 146.9,130.8 148.9,130.7 151.0,130.6 153.0,130.6 155.1,130.6 157.1,130.7 159.2,130.7 161.2,130.8 163.3,131.0 165.3,131.1 167.4,131.3 169.4,131.5 171.5,131.7 173.5,131.9 175.6,132.1 177.6,132.4 179.7,132.6 181.7,132.9 183.8,133.1 185.8,133.4 187.9,133.7 189.9,134.0 191.9,134.3 194.0,134.6 196.0,134.9 198.1,135.2 200.1,135.5 202.2,135.8 204.2,136.1 206.3,136.4 208.3,136.7 210.4,137.0 212.4,137.2 214.5,137.5 216.5,137.8 218.6,138.1 220.6,138.3 222.7,138.6 224.7,138.9 226.8,139.1 228.8,139.4 230.9,139.6 232.9,139.8 234.9,140.1 237.0,140.3 239.0,140.5 241.1,140.7 243.1,140.9 245.2,141.1 247.2,141.3 249.3,141.5 251.3,141.7 253.4,141.9 255.4,142.0 257.5,142.2 259.5,142.4 261.6,142.5 263.6,142.7 265.7,142.8 267.7,143.0 269.8,143.1 271.8,143.2 273.9,143.4 275.9,143.5 278.0,143.6 280.0,143.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='89.8' cy='146.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='49.8' y='162.3'>(1,0)</text><circle cx='153.2' cy='130.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='143.2' y='120.6'>(3, 4/e³)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 146.3H294.0M58.0 184.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='153.2' y1='143.3' x2='153.2' y2='149.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='150.2' y='160.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='216.6' y1='143.3' x2='216.6' y2='149.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='213.6' y='160.3' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='55.0' y1='67.4' x2='61.0' y2='67.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='42.0' y='71.4' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
