  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-6-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean los planos \\(\\pi_1\\equiv2x+y-z+5=0\\) y \\(\\pi_2\\equiv x+2y+z+2=0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula las coordenadas del punto \\(P\\) sabiendo que está en el plano \\(\\pi_1\\) y que su proyección ortogonal sobre el plano \\(\\pi_2\\) es el punto \\((1,0,-3)\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el punto simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto del plano \\(\\pi_2\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(Q(1,0,-3)\\) está en \\(\\pi_2\\) (\\(1+0-3+2=0\\)). \\(P\\) está en la recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi_2\\) que pasa por \\(Q\\), cuyo director es \\(\\vec n_2=(1,2,1)\\): \\(P(1+t,\\,2t,\\,-3+t)\\). Además \\(P\\in\\pi_1\\):</p>\\[2(1+t)+2t-(-3+t)+5=0\\iff3t+10=0\\iff t=-\\frac{10}3\\]<div class='res'>\\(P\\left(-\\dfrac73,-\\dfrac{20}3,-\\dfrac{19}3\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(Q\\) es la proyección de \\(P\\) sobre \\(\\pi_2\\): es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{-\\frac73+a}2=1,\\quad\\frac{-\\frac{20}3+b}2=0,\\quad\\frac{-\\frac{19}3+c}2=-3\\ \\Rightarrow\\ a=\\frac{13}3,\\ b=\\frac{20}3,\\ c=\\frac13\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":15,\"el\":20,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2.692,0.298,0.095],[3.454,-2.775,0.095],[4.292,-1.098,-4.095],[-1.854,1.975,-4.095]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[4.292,-1.098,-4.095],\"π₂\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-2.333,-6.667,-6.333],[4.333,6.667,0.333],\"#e11d48\",1.6,false],[\"pt\",[-2.333,-6.667,-6.333],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,0,-3],\"Q\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[4.333,6.667,0.333],\"P&#39;\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 230' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m05r6b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m05r6b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m05r6b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m05r6b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='202.1,18.0 84.4,63.4 120.6,176.1 238.3,130.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='124.6' y='176.1' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₂</text><line x1='26.0' y1='161.1' x2='314.0' y2='86.7' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='161.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='155.1' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='170.0' cy='123.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.0' y='117.9' font-weight='700'>Q</text><circle cx='314.0' cy='86.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='321.0' y='80.7' font-weight='700'>P'</text><line x1='24' y1='200' x2='19.9' y2='205.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='15.4' y='211.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='200' x2='39.5' y2='201.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.9' y='205.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='200' x2='24.0' y2='185.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='183.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,222)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,222)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(P'\\left(\\dfrac{13}3,\\dfrac{20}3,\\dfrac13\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
